WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.630
A sailing ship, frozen
fast in the Arctic ice,

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:05.210
under a low sun.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.860
On board, a stack of letters,
all addressed to Mrs.

4
00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:10.660
Saville, England.

5
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:15.000
One line stands out: "I
have no friend, Margaret".

6
00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:17.430
A gloved hand opens the letter.

7
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.280
Inside is a smaller bundle of pages.

8
00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:23.320
And inside that, a smaller one still.

9
00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.840
This is a novel about a monster.

10
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:29.040
So why does it open with
letters from a ship?

11
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.930
In this mission, you'll
unpack three narrators,

12
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:34.400
each story told inside another.

13
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:37.170
And you'll meet the
letter-writer, Robert Walton,

14
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:41.170
an explorer, and ask what he
and Victor have in common.

15
00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.040
Your mission: work out why a monster
story opens with letters from a ship.
